        "type": "text/html",
        "value": "<p>Our <em>Statement of Performance Expectations 2024<em>\u2013</em>2025</em> and our <em>Statement of Intentions 2024<em>\u2013</em>2028</em> have been published.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>The Statement of Performance Expectations sets out the specific standards we have committed to achieve in the year starting from 1 July 2024 and our prospective financial statements. The Statement of Intentions sets out how we plan to deliver on our goals over the next four years and our immediate and future areas of strategic significance.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-file\"><a href=\"https://educationpayroll.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Education-Payroll-Statement-of-Performance-Expectations-2024-2025-web.pdf\" id=\"wp-block-file--media-d740e26b-d545-4193-8471-7044ea7026b8\">Education-Payroll-Statement-of-Performance-Expectations-2024-2025 web</a><a class=\"wp-block-file__button\" href=\"https://educationpayroll.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Education-Payroll-Statement-of-Performance-Expectations-2024-2025-web.pdf\">Download</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-file\"><a href=\"https://educationpayroll.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Education-Payroll-Statement-of-Intent-2024-2028-web.pdf\" id=\"wp-block-file--media-b4fe9ddd-0df9-4d2a-966c-c80421f4fb7f\">Education-Payroll-Statement-of-Intent-2024-2028 web</a><a class=\"wp-block-file__button\" href=\"https://educationpayroll.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Education-Payroll-Statement-of-Intent-2024-2028-web.pdf\">Download</a></div>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><a href=\"https://educationpayroll.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/SPE-Cover-image.png\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2074\" height=\"375\" src=\"https://educationpayroll.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/SPE-Cover-image.png\" width=\"268\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>July 2024</p>"
      }
    ],
